│ BMS, Chugai, GSK, Lilly, MSD\xa0…ard.bmj.com"}, {"study_index": 87, "title": "Efficacy and safety of apremilast and  │
│ phototherapy versus phototherapy only in psoriasis vulgaris", "abstract": "Phototherapy and apremilast (oral         │
