Title/Abstract Screening Results for Systemic Pharmacological Treatments for Chronic Plaque Psoriasis Network 
Meta-Analysis

SUMMARY:
- Total studies screened: 100
- Studies INCLUDED: 41 (41%)
- Studies EXCLUDED: 59 (59%)

Key inclusion criteria applied:
- Randomised controlled trials (RCTs) only
- Systemic treatments (not topical)
- Adults >18 years with moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis
- Compared to placebo or another active agent
- Primary outcomes: PASI 90 and serious adverse events at induction phase (8-24 weeks)


