ADDITIONAL CONTEXT AND NOTES:

1. CONSERVATIVE APPROACH: When in doubt about whether a study was an RCT or had appropriate methodology, I leaned toward
INCLUDE to ensure no potentially eligible studies were missed. This is consistent with systematic review best practices.

