│ Q4W regimen were reallocated to remain on the Q4W regimen or uptitrate to Q2W. RESULTS At week 16, Q2W dosing        │
│ (n\u2009=\u2009165) led to significantly higher PASI 90 responses vs. Q4W [n\u2009=\u2009166; 73.2% vs. 55.5%,       │
